    345  0ac9							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    346  0ac9							; Every 1/4 ms: take a MIDI-in byte, feed the ACIA one byte (fast path).
    347  0ac9							; Every fourth time (1 ms):
    348  0ac9							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
