    391  0b0c							; With the MIDI chip's interrupts (midiIrq, v0.16): the chip interrupts when
    392  0b0c							; a byte has come in or the next can go out; the CIA timer ticks each ms.
    393  0b0c				   IrqMidi
    394  0b0c					      subroutine
    395  0b0c		       48		      pha
    396  0b0d		       8a		      txa
