    439  0b57							; RESTORE: the only NMI source. Count presses; the main loop acts on them.
    440  0b57							; (A MIDI chip wired to NMI instead could fire one during MidiIrqTest: that
    441  0b57							; isn't a press.)
    442  0b57				   Nmi
